// src/v4/std/witness.dag
//
// Scope: fail-closed read discipline — no Option::None in lens reads.
// Anchor: THESIS fail-closed discipline + INVARIANTS P3 (no Option::None in lens reads)
//
// Owns:
//   - Witness<C> = Holds(C) | Violates(reason: NamedReason)
//     (Holds CARRIES the proven fact C. A successful read must compose
//     its result forward — a payload-less success variant would silently
//     drop the fact it proved, violating facts-flow-forward / INVARIANTS
//     P2 and re-importing the Option::None hole this type exists to close.)
//   - replaces Option::None at lens read channels
//
// Consumes:
//   - std/node.dag: Disj for sum
//   - std/diagnostic.dag: NamedReason
//
// Status: scaffold — fill per TASKS.md T-3
// Brief: see BRIEF_TEMPLATE.md; this file's I/O contract is the immutable
// contract for the worker. Splitting this file requires explicit operator
// ratification (substrate extension = stop signal).


